		"back": {
			"title": "Helior’s Shining Ring",
			"item": null,
			"description": "When you **_spend the better part of a day wearing_** **_the ring and worshipping Helior in full sunlight_**, hold 1 Daylight.\n\nWhen you **_wear the ring in shadows or darkness_** **_and spend 1 Daylight_**, the ring shines forth with holy light (*near*, *area*) that is painful for creatures of darkness to look at. It glows for a few hours, until you extinguish it, or until another effect (like the Lightbearer’s Invocations) uses up its fuel or snuffs it out.\n\nAlas, the ring also shines like a psychic beacon while it shines, alerting servants of darkness for miles around to your presence and location.",
